exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__elevenlabs__agents_create_code_tool(args: {
  // Advanced compatibility escape hatch: the full raw request body sent to the underlying tools API (e.g. to set `parameters`, `execution_context`, `dynamic_variables`, or `response_mocks`). Overrides the compact fields above when present.
  body?: { [key: string]: unknown; };
